dev:    size   erasesize  name
mtd0: 00030000 00010000 "u-boot"
mtd1: 00010000 00010000 "u-boot-env"
mtd2: 00010000 00010000 "factory"
mtd3: 003b0000 00010000 "firmware"
mtd4: 002c0303 00010000 "rootfs"
mtd5: 00070000 00010000 "rootfs_data"
</code>


===== Hardware =====
==== Overview ====
^ [[docs:techref:hardware:cpu|CPU]]              | MIPS 24KEc V5.0                                     |
^ [[wp>Instruction set|Architecture]]            | MIPS                                                |
^ [[docs:techref:hardware:soc|System-On-Chip]]   | 360 MHZ Ralink RT5350 id:1 rev:3                    |
^ Flash                                          | 4 MB Winbond W25Q32BV                               |
^ RAM                                            | 32 MB Etron EM63A165TS-6G                           |
^ Ethernet                                       | Yes 1x (10/100Mbit )                                |
^ USB                                            | Yes 2x (USB Battery Charging, EHCI/OHCI)            |
^ Power Supply                                   | 8800mAh Li-ion battery (4 Cell 3,6V ICR-18650NH )   |

